      "dcterms:title": "Groupes fondamentaux motiviques de Tate mixte",
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20180528",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0302267",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We deﬁne the category of mixed Tate motives over the ring of S-integers of a number ﬁeld. We deﬁne the motivic fundamental group (made unipotent) of a unirational variety over a number ﬁeld. We apply this to the study of the motivic fundamental group of the projective line punctured at zero, inﬁnity and all N-th roots of unity. ∗Research partially supported by NSF Grant DMS-0099390",
